{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"http-entry","type":"text","text":"## 🌐 HTTP 请求入口\n\n**ManusController.executePlan()**\n\n```java\n@PostMapping(\"/execute\")\npublic PlanExecutionWrapper executePlan(\n    @RequestBody PlanInterface plan,\n    @RequestParam boolean isVueRequest,\n    @RequestParam(required = false) String uploadKey\n)```","fontSize":14,"x":-220,"y":-820,"width":590,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# JManus 规划系统详细调用链路\n## 从 HTTP 请求到工具执行的完整流程\n\n💡 **配合右侧文档使用**: 查看每个组件的详细功能说明和代码示例","fontSize":22,"textAlign":"center","x":-210,"y":-1040,"width":600,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"planning-coordinator","type":"text","text":"## 🔄 PlanningCoordinator\n\n**执行协调器**\n\n```java\n// ManusController.java:638\nCompletableFuture<PlanExecutionResult> future = \nplanningCoordinator.executeByPlan(\n    plan, rootPlanId, null,\n    currentPlanId, null, \n    isVueRequest, uploadKey, 0\n);```\n\n**职责**\n- 创建执行上下文\n- 选择执行策略\n- 协调执行流程","fontSize":14,"x":-200,"y":-400,"width":540,"height":440,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"agent-execution","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 Agent 执行核心\n\n**DynamicAgent.run() 方法**\n\n```java\n// 1. 思考阶段 (Think)\nString thought = llmService.generateThought(\n    context, availableTools\n);\n\n// 2. 行动阶段 (Act)\nList<ToolCall> toolCalls = parseToolCalls(thought);\n\n// 3. 执行工具调用\nexecuteToolCalls(toolCalls);\n```","fontSize":14,"x":-1325,"y":200,"width":750,"height":410,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"execution-context","type":"text","text":"## 📦 ExecutionContext\n\n**执行上下文**\n\n```java\nExecutionContext context = new ExecutionContext();\ncontext.setUserRequest(plan.getUserRequest());\ncontext.setCurrentPlanId(currentPlanId);\ncontext.setRootPlanId(rootPlanId);\ncontext.setPlanDepth(0);  // 根计划\ncontext.setNeedSummary(isVueRequest);\ncontext.setPlan(plan);\n```\n\n**核心信息**\n- planId 层次关系\n- 用户原始请求\n- 执行状态控制","fontSize":12,"x":-315,"y":480,"width":770,"height":450,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tool-execution","type":"text","text":"## ⚙️ 工具执行\n\n**并行执行服务**\n\n```java\n// DynamicAgent.java:892\nList<ToolExecutionResult> parallelResults = \nparallelToolExecutionService.executeToolsInParallel(\n    toolCalls, \n    toolCallbackMap, \n    planIdDispatcher, \n    parentToolContext\n);\n```\n\n**执行特点**\n- 支持并行工具调用\n- 独立的执行上下文\n- 结果聚合处理","fontSize":14,"x":-1207,"y":930,"width":515,"height":480,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"tool-callback-provider","type":"text","text":"## 🔧 ToolCallbackProvider\n\n**工具回调提供者**\n\n```java\n// DynamicAgent.java:885\nMap<String, ToolCallBackContext> toolCallbackMap = \ntoolCallbackProvider.getToolCallBackContext();\n\n// 关键接口\npublic interface ToolCallbackProvider {\n    Map<String, PlanningFactory.ToolCallBackContext> \n    getToolCallBackContext();\n}\n```\n\n**实现位置**: PlanningFactory.toolCallbackMap()","fontSize":14,"x":-160,"y":1520,"width":540,"height":400,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"error-handling","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ 异常处理机制\n\n**多层异常处理**\n\n- HTTP 层: 全局异常捕获\n- 执行层: CompletableFuture 异步异常\n- Agent 层: 工具调用异常隔离\n- 工具层: 单个工具异常不影响整体\n\n**容错策略**\n- 超时控制 (10分钟)\n- 重试机制 (工具级别)\n- 降级处理 (默认工具)","fontSize":12,"x":-1150,"y":2340,"width":350,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"response-return","type":"text","text":"## 📤 响应返回\n\n**结果封装**\n\n```java\n// ManusController 返回\nreturn new PlanExecutionWrapper(\n    future,      // 异步执行结果\n    rootPlanId   // 根计划标识\n);\n```\n\n**响应格式**\n- 异步执行支持\n- 计划层次信息\n- 执行状态追踪","fontSize":14,"x":-420,"y":2318,"width":420,"height":405,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"plan-finalizer","type":"text","text":"## 🏁 计划完成处理\n\n**PlanFinalizer**\n\n```java\n// PlanningCoordinator.java:124\nPlanExecutionResult processedResult = \nplanFinalizer.handlePostExecution(\n    context, result\n);\n```\n\n**后处理功能**\n- 执行结果总结\n- 异常情况处理\n- 资源清理工作\n- 记录执行状态","fontSize":14,"x":-920,"y":1755,"width":550,"height":445,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"execution-timeline","type":"text","text":"## ⏱️ 执行时间线\n\n```\n1. HTTP请求到达 (0ms)\n2. 创建执行上下文 (5ms)\n3. 选择执行器 (10ms)  \n4. 创建智能体 (20ms)\n5. 思考阶段 (100-500ms)\n6. 并行工具执行 (200-2000ms)\n7. 结果处理 (50ms)\n8. 响应返回 (5ms)\n总耗时: 400-3000ms (取决于工具复杂度)\n```","fontSize":12,"x":-2260,"y":1480,"width":485,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tool-implementations","type":"text","text":"## 🛠️ 具体工具实现\n\n**工具类型分布**\n\n### 浏览器自动化\n- `BrowserUseTool` - Playwright 驱动\n- `ChromeDriverService` - 浏览器管理\n\n### 数据库操作  \n- `DatabaseReadTool` - 数据查询\n- `DatabaseWriteTool` - 数据写入\n\n### 文件系统\n- `LocalFileOperator` - 本地文件操作\n- `DirectoryOperator` - 目录管理\n- `TextFileService` - 文本文件处理","fontSize":12,"x":-1680,"y":1820,"width":377,"height":550,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"planning-factory-detail","type":"text","text":"## 🏭 PlanningFactory 详细\n\n**工具注册中心**\n\n```java\n// toolCallbackMap() 核心逻辑\nMap<String, ToolCallBackContext> toolCallbackMap = \nnew HashMap<>();\n\n// 条件性工具加载\nif (agentInit) {\n    // 内置工具: Browser, Database, Bash, File...\n    toolDefinitions.add(BrowserUseTool.getInstance(...));\n    toolDefinitions.add(DatabaseReadTool.getInstance(...));\n    // ...\n}\n\n// MCP 外部工具集成\nList<McpServiceEntity> mcpTools = \nmcpService.getFunctionCallbacks(planId);\n```\n\n**工具类型**\n- 内置系统工具\n- MCP 外部工具\n- 子计划工具","fontSize":12,"x":600,"y":2120,"width":620,"height":650,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"dynamic-tool-executor","type":"text","text":"## ⚡ DynamicToolPlanExecutor\n\n**动态工具执行器**\n\n```java\n// 继承 AbstractPlanExecutor\npublic CompletableFuture<PlanExecutionResult> \nexecuteAllStepsAsync(ExecutionContext context) {\n    // 1. 创建智能体实例\n    // 2. 配置工具回调\n    // 3. 执行推理-行动循环\n    // 4. 处理执行结果\n}\n```\n\n**核心功能**\n- 智能体生命周期管理\n- 工具调用协调\n- 并行执行支持","fontSize":14,"x":850,"y":880,"width":505,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"plan-executor-factory","type":"text","text":"## 🏭 PlanExecutorFactory\n\n**执行器工厂**\n\n```java\n// PlanningCoordinator.java:118\nPlanExecutorInterface executor = \nplanExecutorFactory.createExecutor(plan);\n\nCompletableFuture<PlanExecutionResult> \nexecutionFuture = executor.executeAllStepsAsync(context);\n```\n\n**策略选择**\n- 根据 planType 选择\n- 默认: dynamic_agent\n- 支持扩展其他类型","fontSize":14,"x":805,"y":200,"width":595,"height":440,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"agent-creation","type":"text","text":"## 🤖 智能体创建\n\n**DynamicAgent 实例化**\n\n```java\n// 根据 plan 配置创建\nDynamicAgent agent = new DynamicAgent(\n    plan.getAgentConfig(),\n    llmService,\n    toolCallbackProvider,\n    planIdDispatcher\n);\n```\n\n**关键依赖**\n- LLM 服务\n- 工具回调提供者\n- 计划ID分发器","fontSize":14,"x":1760,"y":880,"width":520,"height":460,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"agent-dependencies","type":"text","text":"## 🔗 Agent 模块依赖关系\n\n**核心依赖链**\n\n```\nBaseAgent (抽象基类)\n├── DynamicAgent (动态实现)\n├── ConfigurableDynaAgent (可配置版本)\n└── ToolCallbackProvider (工具接口)\n\n依赖关系:\nAgent → ToolCallbackProvider → PlanningFactory\n     ↓                      ↓\n  LLM Service           Tool Management\n     ↓                      ↓ \n  Model Config          MCP Integration\n```\n\n**关键特征**\n- 继承层次清晰\n- 依赖接口抽象\n- 工具解耦设计","fontSize":12,"x":1760,"y":1600,"width":520,"height":560,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"79400da4bc9c2659","type":"file","file":"planning-call-flow-explanation.md","x":780,"y":-1670,"width":1120,"height":1400},
		{"id":"color-standard","type":"file","file":"canvas-color-standard.md","x":2200,"y":-1670,"width":800,"height":1200}
	],
